{"_id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60001","name":"Burn","type":"effect","img":"icons/svg/aura.svg","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":100,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"stacks":2,"ticks":3,"startOfTurnText":"BURN: Taking fire damage at the start of this turn! (X = damage taken)","removeStackOnTurn":true,"applyCode":"actor.update({'system.hp.value': Math.max(0, (actor.system.hp.value ?? 0) - stacks)});","passiveText":"On hit, target gains a Burn stack. X = damage taken at start of target's turn (Stacks). Loses 1 Stack per turn like every effect; Y (Ticks Remaining) is a secondary duration cap. Reapplied Burn: take the higher X value and add the Y counters together.","rules":[],"duration":{"unit":"encounter"}}}
{"_id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60002","name":"Freeze","type":"effect","img":"icons/svg/aura.svg","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":200,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"stacks":1,"ticks":0,"startOfTurnText":"FREEZE: This unit cannot act! End of turn: roll 1d20 + Love (DN 14) to break free. Also breaks on any damage taken.","removeStackOnTurn":true,"applyCode":"","passiveText":"Target cannot act. At end of their turn roll 1d20 + total Love vs DN 14 to break. Also breaks immediately if the target takes any damage.","rules":[{"path":"cannotAct","value":1,"mode":"override"}],"duration":{"unit":"encounter"}}}
{"_id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60003","name":"Paralyze","type":"effect","img":"icons/svg/aura.svg","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":300,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"stacks":1,"ticks":0,"startOfTurnText":"PARALYZE: Speed halved. 1-3 stacks: choose Basic Attack OR one Move, not both. 4+ stacks: cannot act. Lose 1 stack this turn. Nat 20 clears all stacks.","removeStackOnTurn":true,"applyCode":"","passiveText":"Target's Speed is halved. X = stacks. At start of target's turn lose 1 stack. 1-3 stacks: choose Basic OR Move Action. 4+ stacks: cannot act. Natural 20 on any roll clears all stacks.","rules":[{"path":"restricted","value":1,"mode":"override"}],"duration":{"unit":"encounter"}}}
{"_id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60004","name":"Blind","type":"effect","img":"icons/svg/aura.svg","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":400,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"stacks":2,"ticks":0,"startOfTurnText":"BLIND: -4 to all attack hit rolls this turn!","removeStackOnTurn":true,"applyCode":"","passiveText":"On hit, target gains 2 Blind stacks. Target suffers -4 to all attack hit rolls while Blind.","rules":[{"path":"hitBonus","value":4,"mode":"subtract"}],"duration":{"unit":"encounter"}}}
{"_id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60005","name":"Confuse","type":"effect","img":"icons/svg/aura.svg","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":500,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"stacks":1,"ticks":0,"startOfTurnText":"CONFUSE: Roll 1d20 + Friendship (DN 14) to snap out. On fail: must attack the nearest ally!","removeStackOnTurn":true,"applyCode":"","passiveText":"At start of the target's turn, roll 1d20 + total Friendship vs DN 14. Fail = must attack the closest ally.","rules":[{"path":"forcedAttack","value":1,"mode":"override"}],"duration":{"unit":"encounter"}}}
{"_id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60006","name":"Drain","type":"effect","img":"icons/svg/aura.svg","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":600,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"stacks":1,"ticks":0,"startOfTurnText":"","removeStackOnTurn":true,"applyCode":"","passiveText":"On hit, the attacker regains HP equal to half the damage dealt (round down, minimum 1). Automated inline in the attack card's Apply button - dragging this item onto a sheet is just a reference marker.","rules":[],"duration":{"unit":"encounter"}}}
{"_id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60007","name":"Push","type":"effect","img":"icons/svg/aura.svg","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":700,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"stacks":1,"ticks":0,"startOfTurnText":"","removeStackOnTurn":true,"applyCode":"","passiveText":"On hit, push the target away. Spaces pushed = Attacker's Courage minus Defender's Courage. Minimum 1 space. No token-movement automation exists - GM moves the token manually.","rules":[],"duration":{"unit":"encounter"}}}
{"_id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60008","name":"Fragment","type":"effect","img":"icons/svg/aura.svg","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":1000,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"stacks":1,"ticks":0,"startOfTurnText":"FRAGMENT: Lose 1 stack. While Fragmented, cannot regain HP from any source.","removeStackOnTurn":true,"applyCode":"","passiveText":"On hit, target gains X Fragment stacks. If already Fragmented, add X to their current stack total. At the start of the target's turn, lose 1 stack. While Fragmented, a Digimon cannot regain HP from any source, including RECOVERY, items, or skill checks.","rules":[{"path":"healingBlocked","value":1,"mode":"override"}],"duration":{"unit":"encounter"}}}
{"_id":"a1b2c3d4e5f6000a","name":"Poison","type":"effect","img":"icons/svg/aura.svg","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":800,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"stacks":1,"ticks":0,"startOfTurnText":"POISON: Taking poison damage at the start of this turn! (X = damage taken)","removeStackOnTurn":true,"applyCode":"actor.update({'system.hp.value': Math.max(0, (actor.system.hp.value ?? 0) - stacks)});","passiveText":"On a natural attack roll of 15 or higher, the target is Poisoned with X stacks. If already Poisoned, add X to their current Poison total. At the start of their turn the target takes damage equal to their current Poison stacks.","rules":[],"duration":{"unit":"encounter"}}}
{"_id":"a1b2c3d4e5f6000b","name":"Sleep","type":"effect","img":"icons/svg/aura.svg","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":900,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"stacks":1,"ticks":0,"startOfTurnText":"SLEEP: This unit is asleep and cannot act! Start of turn: Firewall check DN 13 to wake. Also breaks on any damage taken.","removeStackOnTurn":true,"applyCode":"","passiveText":"Target cannot act. At the start of their turn they make a Firewall skill check DN 13 - on a success they wake and may act normally this turn. They also wake immediately if they take any damage.","rules":[{"path":"cannotAct","value":1,"mode":"override"}],"duration":{"unit":"encounter"}}}
